flowchart TD
  A["Open authorized client in Planner or Pain Atlas"] --> MODE{"Saved mode or explicit choice?"}
  MODE -- Measured --> B["Load profile and timestamped measurements"]
  MODE -- Reference --> MANUAL["Load chosen catalog and visual preferences"]
  MANUAL --> H["Publish atomic morph revision"]
  MANUAL -- Unknown asset --> G["Reference or partial fit; retain measured facts"]
  B --> C{"Valid units and supported fields?"}
  C -- Partial --> D["Apply known inputs; show missing and stale sources"]
  C -- Yes --> E["Fit coordinated custom anatomy"]
  D --> E
  E --> F{"Within reviewed rig and fit limits?"}
  F -- No --> G["Reference or partial fit; retain measured facts"]
  F -- Yes --> H["Publish atomic morph revision"]
  G --> I["Pain reporting remains usable"]
  H --> I
  I --> J["Customize visual preview"]
  J --> K{"Save, cancel or correct measurement?"}
  K -- Cancel --> H
  K -- Save --> L["Save scoped display preference with revision"]
  L --> M{"Outcome?"}
  M -- Committed --> H
  M -- Conflict --> N["Compare saved preference and draft"]
  N --> J
  M -- Uncertain --> O["Check receipt and retry same mutation ID"]
  O --> M
  K -- Correct --> P["Canonical measurement flow; deliberate save"]
  P --> B
  B -- Denied --> Q["Clear private shape and fields"]
  B -- Failed --> R["Same-target stale state; retry"]
  R --> B
  H -- Source changed in measured mode --> B
  MANUAL -- New measurements --> MANUAL
  H -- Rig rollback --> S["Previous approved asset version; preserve reports"]
  S --> I
